---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto scroll-reveal" id="journey">
  <div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2">My Journey</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface font-headline-md">Experience &amp; Education</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim text-lg" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">work</span>
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface">Experience</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="relative pl-6 border-l-2 border-primary/20 dark:border-primary-fixed-dim/20 space-y-6">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[29px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-primary dark:bg-primary-fixed-dim border-[3px] border-background dark:border-on-background"></div>
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-2 flex-wrap">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface text-sm sm:text-base">Data Annotator</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim font-semibold">Kupu.id</p>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary/10 text-tertiary dark:text-tertiary-fixed-dim text-[10px] font-bold uppercase shrink-0">Current</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant mb-3">Feb 2026 - Jun 2026</p>
            <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant space-y-1.5">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim mt-0.5">•</span>Annotated traffic signs, vehicles, traffic lights for Computer Vision</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim mt-0.5">•</span>Ensured high annotation accuracy for AI model training</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim mt-0.5">•</span>Quality assurance and validation on labeled datasets</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[29px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-outline-variant dark:bg-outline border-[3px] border-background dark:border-on-background"></div>
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-2 flex-wrap">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface text-sm sm:text-base">Data Analyst Intern</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim font-semibold">Level Up by Telkom Indonesia</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant mb-3">Aug 2024 - Aug 2025</p>
            <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant space-y-1.5">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim mt-0.5">•</span>Managed, cleaned, organized large datasets using Python</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim mt-0.5">•</span>Built automated data-cleaning system</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim mt-0.5">•</span>Developed performance-tracking dashboard</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[29px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-outline-variant dark:bg-outline border-[3px] border-background dark:border-on-background"></div>
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-2 flex-wrap">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface text-sm sm:text-base">Teaching Assistant Coordinator</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim font-semibold">Telkom University</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant mb-3">Sep 2023 - Mar 2024</p>
            <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant space-y-1.5">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim mt-0.5">•</span>Coordinated between lecturers, assistants, and lab</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim mt-0.5">•</span>Evaluated student practical work</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim mt-0.5">•</span>Prepared final reports</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[29px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-outline-variant dark:bg-outline border-[3px] border-background dark:border-on-background"></div>
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-2 flex-wrap">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface text-sm sm:text-base">Member HR Club</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim font-semibold">SEARCH Telkom University</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant">Jan 2023 - Mar 2023</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary dark:text-secondary-fixed-dim text-lg" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">school</span>
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface">Education</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="relative pl-6 border-l-2 border-secondary/20 dark:border-secondary-fixed-dim/20 space-y-6">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[29px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-secondary dark:bg-secondary-fixed-dim border-[3px] border-background dark:border-on-background"></div>
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-2 flex-wrap">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface text-sm sm:text-base">Bachelor in Data Science</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-secondary dark:text-secondary-fixed-dim font-semibold">Binus Online</p>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 text-secondary dark:text-secondary-fixed-dim text-[10px] font-bold uppercase shrink-0">Now</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant">Feb 2026 - Now</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[29px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-outline-variant dark:bg-outline border-[3px] border-background dark:border-on-background"></div>
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-2 flex-wrap">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface text-sm sm:text-base">Diploma in Information Systems</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-secondary dark:text-secondary-fixed-dim font-semibold">Telkom University</p>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 text-secondary dark:text-secondary-fixed-dim text-[10px] font-bold uppercase shrink-0">Cumlaude</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant mb-3">Aug 2022 - Jul 2025</p>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant">GPA: 3.94/4.00 (Cumlaude)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-tertiary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary dark:text-tertiary-fixed-dim text-lg" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">workspace_premium</span>
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface">Profile Highlights</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card text-center">
            <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim">3.94</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant">Cumlaude GPA</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card text-center">
            <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-secondary dark:text-secondary-fixed-dim">5</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant">Featured Projects</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 sm:mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card p-5 sm:p-6 data-card">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-5">
        <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim text-lg" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">emoji_events</span>
        </span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">Recognition &amp; Awards</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface">Achievements</h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-primary/5 border border-primary/10">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-on-surface dark:text-surface">Passed Funding Stage PKM 2023</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant mt-1">PKM-PI category</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-secondary/5 border border-secondary/10">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-on-surface dark:text-surface">Finalist Jogjajanan Business Plan Competition 2025</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant mt-1">Universitas Gadjah Mada</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-tertiary/5 border border-tertiary/10">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-on-surface dark:text-surface">Bank Indonesia Scholarship Awardee</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant dark:text-surface-variant mt-1">2024 - 2025</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 dark:border-outline/15 surface-card p-5 sm:p-6 data-card">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-5">
        <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary dark:text-secondary-fixed-dim text-lg" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">verified</span>
        </span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary dark:text-secondary-fixed-dim uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">Learning Credentials</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-on-surface dark:text-surface">Certifications</h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5">
        <span class="skill-pill">Getting Started with Data Science (Open)</span>
        <span class="skill-pill">Getting Started with Data Python (Open)</span>
        <span class="skill-pill">Getting Started with SQL (Open)</span>
        <span class="skill-pill">What Is Data Science (Coursera)</span>
        <span class="skill-pill">ASEAN Data Science Explorers 2024 (SAP)</span>
        <span class="skill-pill">Databricks Fundamentals Accreditation</span>
        <span class="skill-pill">Get Started with Databricks for Data Engineering</span>
        <span class="skill-pill">Data Ingestion with Lakeflow Connect</span>
        <span class="skill-pill">Build Data Pipelines with Lakeflow Spark</span>
        <span class="skill-pill">Building Enterprise Applications with Databricks Apps</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
